--- !u!114 &8781529247571663089
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8918009397947604923}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 86a2dbea93805024a9c1d5023d37ee79, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextController
  messages:
  - Rise and shine butter cup;)
  - I've been trapped here for a little too long and you're going to guide my body
    out of here!
  - I'll help you get used to it, but whenever you're ready, you can press "R" to
    quickly start our escape!
  - WASD are going to be your directions, W is forward, A is left, S is backwards
    and D is right!
  - Left click will let you charge some air into your cannon. Holding it lets you
    gather/release more air.
  - Whenever you feel ready to shoot just let go!
  - Shooting at the floor or wall will push you in the opposite direction!
  - That's all for now! Whenever you're ready just head down the hall!
